OL,4,BAlcaraz outplays Zverev for first ATP  
OL,5,BFinals triumph                         
OL,6,GCarlos Alcaraz outplayed world number  
OL,7,Gone Alexander Zverev to end his wait   
OL,8,Gfor a first ATP Finals title and       
OL,9,Gcomplete a remarkable post-injury      
OL,10,Greturn to the sport.                   
OL,12,FA season which began with Alcaraz      
OL,13,Fbecoming the youngest man to complete  
OL,14,Fthe career Grand Slam, before he was   
OL,15,Fruled out for more than four months    
OL,16,Fwith a wrist issue, ended with the     
OL,17,FSpaniard holding aloft another of the  
OL,18,Fsport's biggest trophies.              
